  "goodToKnow": "Die Stange is a pole, rod or bar: die Kleiderstange, die Vorhangstange, eine Stange Zigaretten (a carton). Three idioms are very common: eine Stange Geld (a lot of money), jemandem die Stange halten (to stand by someone), and Kleidung von der Stange (off-the-peg clothes, not tailor-made). In Cologne, beer comes in slim glasses called Stangen, and the waiters (Köbes) keep bringing them until you put a beer mat on top."
